     1	//! Issuer and verifier service for membership credentials.
     2	//!
     3	//! - [`issuer`] onboards issuers and signs credentials for their members.
     4	//! - [`verifier`] checks the presentations members show at the door.
     5	//! - [`resolver`] turns a DID into its DID document; [`transport`] fetches
     6	//!   the documents that are hosted rather than encoded in the DID.
     7	//! - [`status`] and [`store`] keep issued credentials and their revocation state.
     8	//! - [`notifier`] tells subscribed relying parties when a status changes;
     9	//!   [`settings`] holds the tenants' subscriptions and [`webhook`] sends the
    10	//!   calls.
    11	//! - [`credential`] is the wire format shared by all of the above.
